id: konatsian-raised
name: Konatsian-Raised
order: 8
category: mind
# A Factor Trait replaces a Secondary Racial Trait.
importance: secondary
grantsOther: vocation
resource: inheritedtension
resourceLabel: Inherited Tension
resourceMax: 3
description: >
  Reared under the watchful eye of the wise Konatsian race, you have specialized in a single combat role.
text: >
  Konatsian-Raised (Mind): Reared under the watchful eye of the wise Konatsian race, you have specialized in a single combat role.
  (1)-[Passive]: Upon gaining this Factor, select a Vocation (see — Konatsians) to gain access to.
  (2)-[Triggered, Resource]: If an Ally (except a Minion) is Defeated, gain a stack of Inherited Tension (max. 3). Inherited Tension can be spent as if it was Tension for the effects of a Vocation.
  (3)-[Triggered/Start of Turn]: If you are below the Injured Health Threshold, gain a stack of Inherited Tension.

---

# (1) Its header's `grantsOther`: a Vocation, chosen as it is gained.
# (2) Inherited Tension, its Resource (3 at most) - spent as Tension by a Vocation's effects, after Tension itself (chat.mjs
# vocationTension, spendVocationTension).

# (2) An Ally Defeated, not one marked a Minion. Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/ally-defeated, effect 2]
requires !defeatedMinion;
inheritedtension.stacks += 1;

# (3) Injured or Critical as your turn begins.
[triggered/start-of-turn, effect 3]
requires belowThreshold("injured");
inheritedtension.stacks += 1;
